###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000869
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000869> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                      rdfs:subClassOf obo:BFO_0000015 ;
                                      rdfs:label "chemical reaction"@en ,
                                                 "chemische Reaktion"@de ;
                                      skos:definition "Das Auftreten einer chemischen Reaktion ist der Prozess, bei dem Substanzen interagieren, um neue chemische Verbindungen zu bilden oder ihre Molekülstruktur zu verändern."@de ,
                                                      "The occurrence of (a) chemical reaction is the process in which substances interact to form new chemical compounds or alter their molecular structure."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000877
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000877> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                      rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020265> ;
                                      rdfs:label "optical property"@en ,
                                                 "optische Eigenschaft"@de ;
                                      skos:definition "a property that is commonly associated with the domain of optics"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000882
