                                                       ] ;
                                       rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/pmd/fsp/> ;
                                       rdfs:label "particle filtration"@en ;
                                       skos:definition "A filtration in which the aerosol leaving the flame of a flame spray pyrolysis process is drawn by a vacuum pump through a nanoparticle filter, on which the nanoparticles are collected while the gas passes through."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/fsp/FSP_0000051
<https://w3id.org/pmd/fsp/FSP_0000051> rdf:type owl:Class ;
